WEBVTT

00:00:09.240 --> 00:00:10.390
Mornin'...

00:00:10.390 --> 00:00:11.860
Hurry up, Momoka!

00:00:11.860 --> 00:00:13.430
Just gimme a sec.

00:00:13.430 --> 00:00:16.090
I'm using my own clothes for today's shoot, so I need to get changed.

00:00:16.090 --> 00:00:17.930
Why didn't you tell me that earlier?

00:00:17.930 --> 00:00:19.540
I'll bring you some of our new stuff!

00:00:22.880 --> 00:00:24.540
Morning, Dad...

00:00:24.540 --> 00:00:25.420
Good morning.

00:00:25.420 --> 00:00:27.710
Erika, make sure you eat your breakfast!

00:00:27.710 --> 00:00:28.590
Yeah, yeah...

00:00:28.590 --> 00:00:29.770
You only need to say it once!

00:00:29.770 --> 00:00:30.760
Yeah!

00:00:33.450 --> 00:00:36.020
They're always running around like this in the morning...

00:00:36.020 --> 00:00:38.010
I think this'll do nicely.

00:00:46.690 --> 00:00:49.660
Boy, it sure is nice being a model.

00:00:49.660 --> 00:00:55.490
You get to skip school, everyone pampers you, 
and you get to wear pretty clothes at your shoots. {Changed 'bunk off' to skip - that's a British thing and would not make sense to your average mouthbreather magical girl neckbeard viewer. HI GUYS.}

00:00:57.550 --> 00:01:00.830
If it bothers you so much, why
 don't you become a model too? {Changed 'vexes you so' to 'bothers you so much.' Because 'vexes,' no matter how much shitty translators use it, sounds FUCKING DUMB.}

00:01:06.250 --> 00:01:10.720
You two are always like this! 
Will you give it a rest already?

00:01:10.720 --> 00:01:14.590
Still, our daughters are cute even when they're angry!

00:01:14.590 --> 00:01:15.720
That's good!

00:01:16.970 --> 00:01:16.990
{OP}

00:01:18.680 --> 00:01:20.180
HeartCatch

00:01:20.180 --> 00:01:21.640
Precure!

00:01:22.810 --> 00:01:25.190
HeartCatch Precure!

00:01:25.270 --> 00:01:28.190
Now, all together

00:01:28.320 --> 00:01:30.700
HeartCatch Precure!

00:01:30.860 --> 00:01:33.660
Let's make our flowers bloom

00:01:38.750 --> 00:01:41.280
Within each of our chests,

00:01:41.450 --> 00:01:43.950
they begin to sprout

00:01:44.160 --> 00:01:45.580
The seeds of the heart

00:01:45.740 --> 00:01:46.870
are growing

00:01:47.210 --> 00:01:49.500
bit by bit

00:01:49.580 --> 00:01:50.170
Red,

00:01:50.170 --> 00:01:50.790
white

00:01:50.790 --> 00:01:52.080
and yellow

00:01:52.300 --> 00:01:54.880
It's because these blooming buds are

00:01:55.090 --> 00:01:56.300
all varied colors

00:01:56.630 --> 00:01:57.760
that they

00:01:57.880 --> 00:01:59.930
shine so brightly!

00:02:00.820 --> 00:02:05.270
That smile that you've nurtured

00:02:06.100 --> 00:02:07.770
with such care

00:02:07.850 --> 00:02:10.480
will never wither

00:02:11.650 --> 00:02:14.070
HeartCatch Precure!

00:02:14.070 --> 00:02:16.950
Now, all together

00:02:16.950 --> 00:02:19.400
HeartCatch Precure!

00:02:19.570 --> 00:02:22.070
Let's make our flowers bloom!

00:02:22.490 --> 00:02:26.950
They're always right by our sides

00:02:26.950 --> 00:02:27.790
So together

00:02:27.790 --> 00:02:31.670
let's make those pretty flowers of our heart

00:02:31.710 --> 00:02:34.630
bloom even more!

00:02:34.800 --> 00:02:36.130
HeartCatch

00:02:36.130 --> 00:02:37.630
Precure!

00:02:43.890 --> 00:02:45.600
Ta-da!

00:02:46.520 --> 00:02:47.810
Why do you have that?

00:02:48.170 --> 00:02:52.040
Well, I'm always asking you to teach me about fashion, Erika,

00:02:52.040 --> 00:02:55.320
so I thought I'd buy this and study some for myself!

00:03:02.720 --> 00:03:06.980
This model Momoka is really pretty, isn't she?

00:03:06.980 --> 00:03:10.430
She's the most popular and charismatic model at the moment, it seems.

00:03:10.430 --> 00:03:12.210
You must know her, right, Erika?

00:03:13.310 --> 00:03:17.590
That model Momoka... is my older sister.

00:03:17.590 --> 00:03:18.850
Really?

00:03:18.850 --> 00:03:21.300
Wait, what?!

00:03:24.180 --> 00:03:28.810
What is the Cause

00:03:24.180 --> 00:03:28.810
What is the Cause

00:03:30.950 --> 00:03:34.260
My mom was a really charismatic model back in the day.

00:03:34.260 --> 00:03:39.650
So it was only natural for her to expect both me and Momo to become models.

00:03:40.220 --> 00:03:44.000
But in the end, only Momo became a model.

00:03:44.000 --> 00:03:47.760
She got scouted back when she was in 
elementary school, and ever since then...

00:03:47.760 --> 00:03:49.620
So that's what happened.

00:03:54.170 --> 00:03:58.450
<i>Now that she mentions it, back when her 
Flower of the Heart became a Desertrian...</i>

00:04:00.090 --> 00:04:02.590
Doll!

00:04:02.590 --> 00:04:05.940
We're finished!

00:04:05.940 --> 00:04:09.640
I hate you, Momo!{Changed '-mee' to ',' assuming that's a typo.}

00:04:09.640 --> 00:04:15.730
Just cause you're kinda pretty and stylish 
doesn't mean you can act so damn proud!

00:04:13.940 --> 00:04:15.730
No!

00:04:17.690 --> 00:04:20.900
I mean, I'm trying my best too!

00:04:20.900 --> 00:04:24.910
But I'll never be as pretty as Momo!

00:04:24.910 --> 00:04:28.840
I can't help being envious!

00:04:34.540 --> 00:04:36.320
What are you doing?!

00:04:38.140 --> 00:04:41.630
We're sisters, so why do we have to be so different?

00:04:41.630 --> 00:04:44.260
Erika, please stop that!

00:04:47.810 --> 00:04:49.100
E-Erika!

00:04:49.100 --> 00:04:50.260
Hmm?

00:04:50.260 --> 00:04:51.820
U-Um...

00:04:51.820 --> 00:04:55.900
Oh, a new crepe place just opened near the station!

00:04:55.900 --> 00:04:58.570
Why don't we go there after school and do some planning for the Fashion Club?

00:04:58.570 --> 00:05:00.980
Oh, that's a great idea!

00:05:02.030 --> 00:05:03.020
Coffret!

00:05:03.020 --> 00:05:06.910
If that's the plan, let's finish eating and then go invite everyone!

00:05:07.510 --> 00:05:08.300
Okay!

00:05:20.460 --> 00:05:22.650
Today went well, Momoka!

00:05:22.650 --> 00:05:25.300
We'll be counting on you to work just as hard tomorrow!

00:05:25.890 --> 00:05:26.680
Right!

00:05:47.660 --> 00:05:48.770
Oh, I'm sorry.

00:05:48.770 --> 00:05:50.330
No, that's quite all right!

00:05:50.990 --> 00:05:53.790
She spoke to me!

00:05:53.790 --> 00:05:56.540
You're so lucky! I'm jealous!

00:06:05.470 --> 00:06:07.130
Momoka!

00:06:09.100 --> 00:06:10.760
It worked!

00:06:10.760 --> 00:06:12.600
She's so pretty!

00:06:16.580 --> 00:06:17.350
Momoka?

00:06:18.020 --> 00:06:19.310
Yuri! {LOWENTHAL?!}

00:06:19.890 --> 00:06:22.270
I've brought you the notes from this morning's lessons.

00:06:22.740 --> 00:06:24.340
Thanks for always doing this for me.

00:06:30.080 --> 00:06:31.530
Hey, Yuri... {GAGARIN?!}

00:06:33.040 --> 00:06:36.910
It might be a bit selfish of me to think this, but...

00:06:37.390 --> 00:06:38.210
What is it?

00:06:39.380 --> 00:06:41.990
No, it's nothing.

00:06:42.960 --> 00:06:43.720
I see.

00:06:49.340 --> 00:06:52.850
Ta-da! Here are my design sketches!

00:06:52.850 --> 00:06:55.490
Wow, they're really pretty!

00:06:55.490 --> 00:06:58.110
You really are the daughter of the Fairy Drop owners!

00:06:59.800 --> 00:07:04.860
In any case, I'd like you all to make some designs like this! {"I'd like to you all to." Stop drinking while translating.}

00:07:05.280 --> 00:07:06.680
Sounds like fun!

00:07:06.680 --> 00:07:10.880
And after we make the designs, we'll actually make them for real?!

00:07:10.880 --> 00:07:13.670
You've got it, Rumicchi! You catch on quick!

00:07:17.290 --> 00:07:20.040
Whoa! It's Kurumi Momoka!

00:07:20.040 --> 00:07:21.250
Please give me your autograph!

00:07:21.780 --> 00:07:23.340
May I take a photo?!

00:07:24.790 --> 00:07:26.490
Isn't that Momoka?

00:07:26.490 --> 00:07:27.760
For real?!

00:07:31.720 --> 00:07:33.260
Momo...

00:07:33.260 --> 00:07:34.070
No way!

00:07:34.070 --> 00:07:35.640
Momoka?!

00:07:38.100 --> 00:07:42.300
She's so prettyyyyyy! {Added tilde. I hate you, Magenta.Tilde goes before punctuation, twatmunch!}

00:07:43.660 --> 00:07:45.080
She's so beautiful...

00:07:45.080 --> 00:07:48.570
It's kinda shocking that Momoka is Erika's sister...

00:07:48.570 --> 00:07:50.150
Yeah, it is.

00:07:55.120 --> 00:07:58.580
E-ri-ka!

00:07:59.860 --> 00:08:01.580
Wh-Wh-What do you want?!

00:08:02.220 --> 00:08:04.500
You want to come watch my photo shoot?

00:08:04.500 --> 00:08:06.380
Well, it's my friends...

00:08:06.380 --> 00:08:10.290
They insisted on coming to see you while you're modeling. {Whilst to while.}

00:08:11.510 --> 00:08:19.980
I told them no, but they said that it was a good chance to study fashion, so I couldn't exactly refuse...

00:08:19.980 --> 00:08:21.780
Study fashion?

00:08:21.780 --> 00:08:24.770
Oh, you run the Fashion Club, right?

00:08:24.770 --> 00:08:25.720
What of it?

00:08:25.720 --> 00:08:26.980
What exactly is it you do?

00:08:26.980 --> 00:08:30.460
If you show me that, I'll let you come to the shoot tomorrow.

00:08:34.220 --> 00:08:37.470
O God, O Buddha, O Erika! I'm begging you!

00:08:37.470 --> 00:08:38.450
Just this once!

00:08:38.450 --> 00:08:39.700
This'll be the last time!

00:08:39.700 --> 00:08:41.200
Please!

00:08:45.620 --> 00:08:47.530
Fine, whatever!

00:08:47.530 --> 00:08:50.780
Here! These are designs for some clothes I'm going to make!

00:09:02.950 --> 00:09:04.440
That's enough, right?!

00:09:04.440 --> 00:09:06.330
We'll be coming to see you tomorrow, all right?!

00:09:13.820 --> 00:09:18.660
Why do I have to put myself through this humiliation?!

00:09:18.660 --> 00:09:20.280
Erika, what's the matter?!

00:09:23.570 --> 00:09:25.990
The Fashion Club, huh?

00:09:25.990 --> 00:09:28.800
Wow, this is a really crude design.

00:09:28.800 --> 00:09:31.740
Though I guess you amateurs are trying as hard as you can.

00:09:36.950 --> 00:09:39.300
This is all your fault, Tsubomi!

00:09:43.890 --> 00:09:49.060
I think this new summer swimsuit will really suit me!

00:09:49.750 --> 00:09:52.590
If you can't even make yourself beautiful without dressing up...

00:09:52.590 --> 00:09:54.520
We really are worlds apart. Tu es trés pitoyable.

00:09:54.520 --> 00:09:56.430
Wh-What did you say?!

00:09:56.430 --> 00:09:58.280
You truly are pathetic!

00:09:58.770 --> 00:10:00.210
Weak! All of you, weak!

00:10:00.210 --> 00:10:03.650
A real man meets conflict bare and unshielded! {'If you're a real man meets conflict' -> 'A real man meets conflict.' Also, Kumojacky supports not using a condom on the first date.}

00:10:06.000 --> 00:10:08.010
Do not entrust this to the likes of them.

00:10:08.010 --> 00:10:11.340
This time, I shall defeat the Precure.

00:10:12.020 --> 00:10:13.180
Very well.

00:10:50.380 --> 00:10:54.040
Um, sorry to bother you... I'm Kurumi Momoka's sister.

00:10:54.450 --> 00:10:59.260
Yeah, yeah. We get girls like you occasionally, 
thinking they can get in by saying stuff like that.

00:10:59.610 --> 00:11:02.060
Hey, what's with you?!

00:11:02.060 --> 00:11:03.680
Erika really is...

00:11:03.680 --> 00:11:06.670
Right, right. You're disturbing the shoot, so if you'd just...

00:11:08.160 --> 00:11:12.100
Sorry about this! She really is my little sister.

00:11:12.100 --> 00:11:14.330
She and her friends came to observe the shoot.

00:11:14.330 --> 00:11:17.780
Seriously?! I'm really sorry about this...

00:11:19.040 --> 00:11:21.700
Thanks for always looking out for Erika.

00:11:21.700 --> 00:11:24.070
Just relax and observe, okay?

00:11:24.070 --> 00:11:26.080
O-O-O-Okay!

00:11:33.040 --> 00:11:34.710
It's certainly frantic down there.

00:11:35.080 --> 00:11:39.670
Well, that's fine. Now, where's someone with a usable Flower of the Heart...

00:11:47.170 --> 00:11:49.110
All right then, one last pose if you would. {Alright -> All right.}

00:11:49.110 --> 00:11:50.560
Right!

00:11:50.560 --> 00:11:52.830
Models sure are amazing...

00:11:52.830 --> 00:11:54.810
They sure are. She's really cool!

00:11:56.230 --> 00:11:59.570
I wish I had an older sister like her...

00:11:59.570 --> 00:12:02.040
If I could give her to you, I would!

00:12:02.040 --> 00:12:04.460
Insensitive little... {'fob her off on' -> 'give her to.' British.}

00:12:04.460 --> 00:12:06.100
What?

00:12:06.100 --> 00:12:07.500
Erika!

00:12:07.500 --> 00:12:08.460
You're blushing...

00:12:08.460 --> 00:12:09.920
You're so cute!

00:12:11.600 --> 00:12:13.260
Stop it!

00:12:26.280 --> 00:12:27.190
Hrm?

00:12:36.670 --> 00:12:38.660
I'm gonna keep tickling you!

00:12:41.640 --> 00:12:43.070
H-Hey, you guys!

00:12:46.000 --> 00:12:49.240
If you're going to observe, please do it quietly!

00:12:49.240 --> 00:12:51.310
We're sorry...

00:12:51.310 --> 00:12:53.910
Okay, Momoka, let's restart. {Alright -> All right.}

00:12:56.700 --> 00:12:57.730
Momoka?

00:13:02.560 --> 00:13:03.630
Who are you?!

00:13:03.630 --> 00:13:07.590
I am a Commander of the Desert Apostles... Kumojacky!

00:13:08.980 --> 00:13:13.310
The Flower of your Heart is 
about to wilt, so I shall take it!

00:13:14.140 --> 00:13:17.230
Flower of the Heart, show yourself!

00:13:23.910 --> 00:13:25.150
Momo!

00:13:28.110 --> 00:13:30.030
Momo! Momo!

00:13:33.450 --> 00:13:35.210
I suppose that will suffice.

00:13:35.800 --> 00:13:38.620
You're up, Desertrian!

00:13:42.810 --> 00:13:44.670
Looks like it's a weak one...

00:13:44.670 --> 00:13:47.550
Well, it'll do. Desertrian, run wild!

00:13:47.550 --> 00:13:49.900
Beaaaaauuutyyyy!

00:13:55.310 --> 00:13:56.440
Tsubomi!

00:13:56.440 --> 00:13:57.670
Erika!

00:13:58.740 --> 00:14:02.760
Erika, let's transform and save Momoka!

00:14:02.760 --> 00:14:03.780
Yeah!

00:14:14.090 --> 00:14:17.460
Go, Seeds of the Precure!

00:14:20.430 --> 00:14:21.700
Precure!

00:14:21.700 --> 00:14:23.420
Open My Heart!

00:15:08.200 --> 00:15:11.220
A lone flower, blooming from the earth!

00:15:14.450 --> 00:15:16.340
Cure Blossom!

00:15:19.020 --> 00:15:21.940
A lone flower, swaying in the sea breeze!

00:15:24.980 --> 00:15:26.510
Cure Marine!

00:15:31.110 --> 00:15:33.890
HeartCatch Precure!

00:15:36.290 --> 00:15:38.500
So you show yourselves, Precure.

00:15:38.500 --> 00:15:39.870
Go get them, Desertrian!

00:15:52.190 --> 00:15:57.840
No one... No one understands how I feel!

00:16:00.850 --> 00:16:02.060
Marine!

00:16:05.110 --> 00:16:06.320
Blossom...

00:16:07.840 --> 00:16:08.860
Shower!

00:16:14.900 --> 00:16:19.070
Certainly, I have attained my dream of becoming a model.

00:16:19.070 --> 00:16:25.080
I get to wear pretty clothes, appear in 
magazines, and all of my fans cheer me on.

00:16:25.080 --> 00:16:29.320
But because of that, I've lost so many things.

00:16:29.320 --> 00:16:32.530
A normal life, with normal friends.

00:16:32.530 --> 00:16:35.550
Erika's my sister, but I can't help being envious of her!

00:16:37.300 --> 00:16:38.560
Momoka...

00:16:40.790 --> 00:16:43.290
Let loose your wails, Desertrian!

00:16:43.290 --> 00:16:46.020
Run wild until the Flower of your Heart wilts!

00:16:46.020 --> 00:16:49.540
I don't want to be treated differently.

00:16:49.540 --> 00:16:52.810
I just want to be able to have fun with my friends!

00:16:52.810 --> 00:16:55.110
Is that too much to ask?!

00:16:56.320 --> 00:16:58.780
Puff puff puff puff puff!

00:17:14.800 --> 00:17:19.110
This Desertrian's surprisingly
 capable considering how it looks.

00:17:19.110 --> 00:17:22.770
Now, run wild until the Flower of your Heart has wilted! {Is he really basically repeating himself from 30 seconds ago?}

00:17:22.770 --> 00:17:25.940
Beauuuuuuuuutyyyyyyyyyy!

00:17:25.940 --> 00:17:27.390
Stop it...

00:17:27.390 --> 00:17:31.110
Don't.... play with her heart any more!

00:17:31.110 --> 00:17:33.980
It is not I who is playing here. {It's to 'it is.' Sounds more dramatic.}

00:17:33.980 --> 00:17:38.040
It's the fault of those she holds dear 
being unable to empathize with her!

00:17:38.530 --> 00:17:40.700
That's... not true!

00:17:41.520 --> 00:17:47.210
Maybe we haven't noticed the loneliness within her heart...

00:17:47.210 --> 00:17:51.060
But the one who dragged out her heart and toyed with it like this...

00:17:51.060 --> 00:17:53.170
was you, Kumojacky!

00:17:53.610 --> 00:17:57.510
And I've had it up to here with this!

00:17:57.510 --> 00:17:59.380
Blossom...

00:17:59.380 --> 00:18:05.280
I can't forgive myself for not 
noticing Momo's feelings before.

00:18:05.280 --> 00:18:05.930
But...

00:18:06.450 --> 00:18:09.690
that's why I'll definitely save Momo!

00:18:09.690 --> 00:18:11.110
Right!

00:18:11.560 --> 00:18:16.090
My heart may be more vast than the sea, but this is as much as it can take! {Catchphrase attained?}

00:18:16.090 --> 00:18:18.530
Say your prayers, Kumojacky!

00:18:19.330 --> 00:18:21.680
If you think you can defeat me, then go ahead and try!

00:18:21.680 --> 00:18:22.370
Desertrian!

00:18:22.370 --> 00:18:25.330
Puff puff puff puff puff puff puff!

00:18:25.330 --> 00:18:28.030
You're not going to catch me with that!

00:18:28.030 --> 00:18:29.750
I won't fall for the same trick twice! {Removed 'out.'Adding back in to restore meaning}

00:18:30.320 --> 00:18:33.750
Blossom Flower Storm!

00:18:37.090 --> 00:18:38.090
Wh-What?!

00:18:38.090 --> 00:18:39.970
Marine! Now's your chance!

00:18:39.970 --> 00:18:40.860
Right!

00:18:48.380 --> 00:18:51.190
Gather, Floral Power!

00:18:52.630 --> 00:18:54.250
Marine Tact!

00:19:03.870 --> 00:19:05.580
Flowers, glitter bright!

00:19:08.660 --> 00:19:13.880
Precure Blue Forte Wave!

00:19:36.530 --> 00:19:40.740
Tch... I guess makeup is as weak as it seems.

00:19:47.840 --> 00:19:49.000
Momo!

00:19:50.200 --> 00:19:52.990
In the language of flowers, a dahlia means "elegance."

00:19:52.990 --> 00:19:55.620
It suits Momoka perfectly!

00:19:55.620 --> 00:19:56.500
Yeah!

00:20:02.530 --> 00:20:04.600
Just what happened back there?

00:20:04.600 --> 00:20:09.170
I thought it was a dream, but the staff said they saw a strange monster as well...

00:20:09.170 --> 00:20:10.310
Maybe it was some kind of prank.

00:20:10.310 --> 00:20:12.250
Who knows?

00:20:12.250 --> 00:20:14.510
By the way, Momo...

00:20:14.510 --> 00:20:15.310
What is it?

00:20:15.670 --> 00:20:19.940
Working as a model isn't all it's cracked up to be, is it?

00:20:19.940 --> 00:20:22.800
Like, how do I put this...

00:20:22.800 --> 00:20:23.490
I'm sorry.

00:20:23.490 --> 00:20:27.010
Yeah, it sure is a lot of trouble.

00:20:27.010 --> 00:20:29.740
Especially for a popular model like me!

00:20:30.640 --> 00:20:31.500
But you know...

00:20:32.290 --> 00:20:38.670
I put everything I could into becoming a model, so when it finally paid off, I was so happy.

00:20:38.670 --> 00:20:43.790
The clothes I model become fashionable, and my fans imitate my hairstyles.

00:20:45.280 --> 00:20:48.260
That's why I don't want to give this up.

00:20:48.260 --> 00:20:49.450
Momo...

00:20:50.320 --> 00:20:51.610
I'll be fine!

00:20:51.610 --> 00:20:55.940
My dream of becoming a model came true, so my new dream is to make some friends!

00:20:56.310 --> 00:20:59.740
I'm going to follow your example and make a lot of friends!

00:21:01.270 --> 00:21:02.400
Okay!

00:21:07.060 --> 00:21:10.040
I think a Heart Seed is going to be born...

00:21:23.340 --> 00:21:26.630
Who'd've thought you of all people would worry about me, though?

00:21:26.630 --> 00:21:28.470
What?! That's not very nice!

00:21:28.470 --> 00:21:32.320
Oh, let me clarify. I meant, "Who'd've thought a little brat like you..."

00:21:32.320 --> 00:21:35.600
I'm not a brat! I'm already in middle school!

00:21:35.600 --> 00:21:37.330
Oh really now...

00:21:37.330 --> 00:21:41.110
Now that you mention it, that 
design of yours was pretty good.

00:21:42.770 --> 00:21:45.000
You might've grown up. Just a little, mind you. {Added 'you.'}

00:21:45.000 --> 00:21:48.320
Don't change the subject like that! {'fob' -> 'brush.'}

00:21:48.320 --> 00:21:51.430
I wasn't trying to do anything!

00:21:51.430 --> 00:21:52.580
Jeez!

00:21:52.930 --> 00:21:55.500
I was paying you a compliment, so 
you really should be more grateful.

00:22:09.890 --> 00:22:09.920
{ED}

