HeartCatch!

00:22:24.900 --> 00:22:27.570
HeartCatch Precure!

00:22:33.620 --> 00:22:36.120
The flower blooms with an "Open sesame!"

00:22:36.750 --> 00:22:39.080
In the wardrobe of my heart

00:22:39.630 --> 00:22:42.250
are all the things that a girl loves

00:22:42.550 --> 00:22:44.710
Look, they're packed in so tight

00:22:45.260 --> 00:22:48.130
My makeover was a huge success

00:22:48.430 --> 00:22:50.680
thanks to this scrunchie and this frilly tunic!

00:22:51.390 --> 00:22:53.680
Our girly showtime

00:22:54.060 --> 00:22:56.520
is about to begin!

00:22:57.020 --> 00:22:59.730
Is my coordination lookin' good today?

00:22:59.850 --> 00:23:02.650
Shuffle! Colorful! Beautiful!

00:23:02.940 --> 00:23:05.570
Mismatches are just part of my character v(^^)v

00:23:05.820 --> 00:23:07.110
We're pretty

00:23:07.280 --> 00:23:08.910
at full bloom!

00:23:09.570 --> 00:23:12.030
If you polish your heart

00:23:12.450 --> 00:23:15.080
until it shines

00:23:15.410 --> 00:23:16.620
Then even the darkness

00:23:16.790 --> 00:23:20.870
will become a guiding light

00:23:21.250 --> 00:23:23.880
So don't sulk

00:23:24.090 --> 00:23:26.800
because a smile's the best!

00:23:26.970 --> 00:23:30.260
Let's make them bloom, facing the sun

00:23:30.340 --> 00:23:33.470
The flowers of our hearts

00:23:35.140 --> 00:23:36.350
HeartCatch!

00:23:36.520 --> 00:23:39.810
HeartCatch Precure!

00:23:42.350 --> 00:23:47.610
<i>When I was young, I was with my Grandma, 
always waiting for my beloved father and mother.</i>

00:23:48.060 --> 00:23:53.570
<i>I knew they were busy with work, but I
 could never stop the tears from welling.</i>

00:23:53.570 --> 00:23:56.790
<i>But now that I'm in middle school, I'm an adult! {Added 'that.'}</i>

00:23:56.790 --> 00:24:00.870
<i>And no matter how busy my father gets, I'll wait here, patiently, for as long as it takes.</i>

00:24:01.530 --> 00:24:02.920
HeartCatch Precure<i>:</i>

00:24:02.920 --> 00:24:06.590
My Father's Been Scouted<i>!</i>

